      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOWDENE (2) has been hitting the line nicely and should appreciate stretching to 1200m third-up. Low draw can settle him closer and he looks the main danger. FANCY GEEONE (8) was safely last start, yet her prior Mdn win was sharp and she now meets the winner with a good pull at the weights. Can make her presence felt. BLESSED BOOM (6) couldn't keep up with them fresh but is a likely improver second-up and is drawn to get all the favours on the inside. Is one to keep in mind. The lightly raced MISSILE SHOT (3) returns for the Birchley camp and has been readied with a trio of trials. Has shown enough signs in four runs to warrant respect first-up.",
